-4aa3-a93f-c501d0d9e284"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Predicted species: versicolor\n","versicolor    100.0 %\n","setosa          0.0 %\n","virginica       0.0 %\n","dtype: object\n"]}],"source":["new_flower = pd.DataFrame([{\"sepal_length\": 6.1, \"sepal_width\": 2.9, \"petal_length\": 4.7, \"petal_width\": 1.4}])\n","proba = pd.Series(model.predict_proba(new_flower)[0], index=model.classes_).sort_values(ascending=False)\n","print(\"Predicted species:\", model.predict(new_flower)[0])\n","print((proba * 100).round(1).astype(str) + \" %\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"H5zdYaMDRnnt","metadata":{"id":"H5zdYaMDRnnt"},"source":["## 10. Conclusion"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"xyVCZHOiRnnt","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"elapsed":0,"status":"ok","timestamp":1790739124749,"user":{"displayName":"I.Rihana Sulthana","userId":"13617876133183882723"},"user_tz":-330},"id":"xyVCZHOiRnnt","outputId":"2c9445e0-6493-4f5c-c42f-653c4a754863"},"outputs":[{"metadata":{"tags":null},"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Final model      : KNN (K=3) with StandardScaler\n","Test accuracy    : 93.3%\n","Test macro F1    : 0.933\n","10-fold CV F1    : 0.946 (+/- 0.072)\n"]}],"source":["print(f\"Final model      : KNN (K={best_k}) with StandardScaler\")\n","print(f\"Test accuracy    : {acc:.1%}\")\n","print(f\"Test macro F1    : {f1:.3f}\")\n","print(f\"10-fold CV F1    : {comparison.iloc[0]['CV Macro F1 (mean)']:.3f} (+/- {comparison.iloc[0]['CV Std']:.3f})\")"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"mFyTeTfuRnnu","metadata":{"id":"mFyTeTfuRnnu"},"source":["### Summary\n","- **Pipeline:** the full workflow was completed: load → explore → scale → shuffled, stratified 80/20 split → tune K by cross-validation → fit → predict → validate.\n","- **Result:** KNN separates the three species with high accuracy. *Setosa* is classified almost perfectly, and the few errors involve *Versicolor* and *V